    "detailed_description": "<h1>Our new game</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Humanity is enslaved by an AI\u2026 which is awesome, because we\u2019re on the right side of the conflict. Exploit puny humans to extract power and build your own empire! You\u2019ll have to keep track of them to make sure they don\u2019t succumb to exhaustion and hunger\u2026 although the weakest ones can always be thrown to the Bioreactor.<br>In other words, this is a resource management sim with rogue-lite elements, dramatic plot, and an abundance of pop culture references. Also, jokes. Slaughter has never been so fun!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features</h2> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Humor as dark as your ex\u2019s heart. Immerse yourself in the life of a merciless tyrant!! <br></li><li> Resource management on steroids. Think fast, to the point, and abandon pity!<br></li><li> Rogue-lite. Every walkthrough is unique due to randomly generated events. And every failure is fatal \u2014 you\u2019ll have to start over!<br></li><li> Easy to learn, hard to master. It only takes a couple minutes to figure out the game\u2019s mechanics, but using them optimally is no small feat!</li></ul>",
